{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfnvbb3nPmjDWZ5FwxErX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to add the apply_coupon function to pricing.py. The function should:\n1. Take an order and a coupon code\n2. Calculate the subtotal\n3. Apply the appropriate discount\n4. Ensure the result is never below $0.00\n5. Round half-up to cents\n6. Raise InvalidCoupon for unsupported codes\n\nLet me implement this function:\n\n```python\ndef apply_coupon(order: Order, code: str) -> Decimal:\n    original_subtotal = subtotal(order)\n    \n    if code == \"SAVE10\":\n        discount = original_subtotal * Decimal(\"0.10\")\n        final_amount = original_subtotal - discount\n    elif code == \"FLAT5\":\n        final_amount = original_subtotal - Decimal(\"5.00\")\n    else:\n        raise InvalidCoupon(f\"coupon code '{code}' is not valid\")\n    \n    # Ensure amount is never below $0.00\n    final_amount = max(final_amount, Decimal(\"0.00\"))\n    \n    # Round half-up to cents\n    return to_cents(final_amount)\n```\n\nWait, let me think about this more carefully. The spec says:\n- \"SAVE10\" = 10% off the subtotal\n- \"FLAT5\" = $5 off the subtotal (never below $0.00)\n\nSo I need to:\n1. Calculate the discount first\n2. Round the discount if needed? Or round the final result?\n\nThe requirement says \"returns the order subtotal after the coupon, rounded half-up to cents\". So I should round the final result.\n\nFor SAVE10: 10% of subtotal, subtract from subtotal\nFor FLAT5: $5 off\n\nLet me refine:\n\n```python\ndef apply_coupon(order: Order, code: str) -> Decimal:\n    original_subtotal = subtotal(order)\n    \n    if code == \"SAVE10\":\n        discount = original_subtotal * Decimal(\"0.10\")\n        final_amount = original_subtotal - discount\n    elif code == \"FLAT5\":\n        final_amount = original_subtotal - Decimal(\"5.00\")\n    else:\n        raise InvalidCoupon(f\"coupon code '{code}' is not valid\")\n    \n    final_amount = max(final_amount, Decimal(\"0.00\"))\n    return to_cents(final_amount)\n```\n\nThis looks right - calculate the discount based on code, clamp at zero, then round to cents.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":375,"cache_read_input_tokens":37150,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":375},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9810014e-dd64-4115-a0db-81396ce1e787","uuid":"7bf0ea58-0a84-4ff4-8a6c-c73f0d137b6a","request_id":"req_011CfnvbaoeeukjUmk9BDTnU"}
